  "name": "Wildfire Flier",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Wildfire_Flier",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-07T08:04:06.206Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*A shabby handwritten flyer. You can feel the writer's effort as the paper has been penetrated at several characters, but you can still read it.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3a816692e7c54c1d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Boulder Town residents"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When you receive this flyer,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "you should know that the fissure is now corroding our home."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the past, we had Silvermane Guards repelling invading monsters at the front line."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "However, with an order, the soldiers have been sent away to the distant battle field."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They never come back."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c29ce801f812c6ac"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Without protection from the Silvermane Guards, we saw the tragedy of the Rivet Town."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Some escaped to the Boulder Town, struggling for a new life."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Some went into the mines, living a homeless life."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But are those misfortunes fated?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dbfd9581c7e375fd"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Of course not!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-202ec7cae909d85d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pick up your pickaxes, take your explosions."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We know that the fissure's corrosion never stops. We know that monsters are running towards us."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Stop daydreaming about when the Silvermane Guards would return. We can protect ourselves!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This is our belief, Wildfire's belief."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-83f7812adf8aa285"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Wildfire not only want warriors."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We want more people to stand together and maintain the city's order from collapsing."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We also need more people to contribute to scientific medical aids."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We also want more people to discuss the future of the Underworld."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We look forward to your participation."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-47cf2ebca863a221"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Join Us"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You can ask any Wildfire member you see in the Underworld about how to join us."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c57fcf57c100c210"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Gathering Spot"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Boulder Town, behind the Gathering Place (Turn right when you arrive at the barrel decoration on the top, then go straight.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f7819fdbb115a7b4"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
